## Review Notes

- **Provenance:** Adapted from Beautiful UI (https://www.beautifului.dev), © 2026 Shane Levine, MIT.
- **Divergence from upstream:** Upstream uses a bare `<a target="_blank">` that navigates directly. This port switches to `preventDefault()` plus an `open` event, matching the existing `TxSources` convention — a hard requirement under an Electron host.
- **Two underline strategies:** Upstream writes the record-name column and the link column two different ways; this component collapses that into one `underline` prop.
